<title>USA: AFP Imaging to buy back one million shares.</title>
<headline>AFP Imaging to buy back one million shares.</headline>
<dateline>ELMSFORD, N.Y. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>AFP Imaging Corp said it will buy back up to one million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it will buy back the shares from time to time, as market conditions permit.</p>
<p>As of September 31, the company said it had 9,519,609 common and preferred shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company makes medical and dental equipment.</p>
</text>
